            <ArticleTitle>[Siwu series decoctions for treating primary dysmenorrea of gynecology blood stasis syndrome--research progress of Taohong Siwu decoction].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>814-21</MedlinePgn>
